OL,3,ABurnham pressed on economy at first
OL,4,APMQs as UK borrowing costs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch has
OL,7,Fpressed Andy Burnham over UK borrowing
OL,8,Fand spending at his first Prime
OL,9,FMinister's Questions.
OL,11,FBadenoch called on the PM to say where
OL,12,Fspending would be cut and how he would
OL,13,Fdeal with the UK's increasing debt,
OL,14,Fafter the cost of borrowing for the UK
OL,15,Frose, reaching a new 18-year high on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,18,FThe PM blamed the previous Conservative
OL,19,Fgovernment saying that the "turbulence
OL,20,Fon global markets are because of that
OL,21,Fexposure that they left behind".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
